\[
f(x) = \left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{6}}\right)^x \quad \text{and} \quad f(x) = \left(-\frac{1}{\sqrt{6}}\right)^x
\]

However, the original answer only provides one of these functions, which is:
\[
\boxed{f(x) = \left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{6}}\right)^x}
\]
