(b) $\int_{0}^{1}\left(3 e^{x}+2 \sqrt{x}\right) d x = 3 e^{x} + \frac{4}{3} x^{3/2} \bigg|_{0}^{1} = 3 e^{1} + \frac{4}{3} - 3 e^{0} - \frac{4}{3} \cdot 0^{3/2} = 3e - 3$  

