\[
I = \frac{b t^3}{3}
\]
Substituting \( I \) into the deflection equation:
\[
\delta_{\text{max}} = \frac{P L^3}{12E \left(\frac{b t^3}{3}\right)} = \frac{P L^3}{4E b t^3}
\]
Thus, the maximum deflection is:
\[
\boxed{\delta_{\text{max}} = \frac{P L^3}{4E b t^3}}
\]
