To calculate the built-off voltage \(V_{BS}\) for the given conditions, we use the Shock-Shock relation for p-channel MOSFET:

\[
V_T = V_{T0} + \alpha V_{BS}
\]

Given:
- Threshold voltage shift: \(\Delta V_T = -1.0 \text{ V}\)
- Oxide thickness: \(t_{ox} = 500 \text{ Å} = 500 \times 10^{-8} \text{ cm}\)
- Donor doping concentration: \(N_d = 10^{16} \text{ cm}^{-3}\)

