q_0 \approx \frac{1}{V} \left(\frac{2\pi m k T}{h^2}\right)^{3/2}
\]

Thus, the total partition function becomes:

\[
q \approx \frac{1}{N!} \left(\frac{2\pi m k T}{h^2}\right)^{3N/2}
